+## 22. The dead Unsplash code is gone
+
+### F-49 · Deleting the component was the only way to prove the calls had stopped
+
+Patch 17 removed both `RotatingBackground` mounts from `home-client.tsx`. The
+production build confirmed it — the homepage bundle dropped from 33.7 kB to
+32.8 kB — and a grep of the whole app found no remaining caller.
+
+But the very next `pnpm dev` still logged:
+
+```
+GET /api/backgrounds?theme=hero  200 in 5356ms
+GET /api/backgrounds?theme=craft 200 in 5457ms
+```
+
+The explanation is a browser tab left open from an earlier session, still
+running the previous client bundle and re-firing its effect on reconnect. That
+is almost certainly right — and "almost certainly" is exactly the standard this
+project has been burned by five times (F-34, the reduced-motion false positives,
+the `<div onClick>` scrims, the two-`<h1>` files, the stale-build audit).
+
+So rather than argue about a ghost, the machinery is deleted:
+
+- `apps/web/app/components/RotatingBackground.tsx` — 63 lines, no importer
+- `apps/web/app/api/backgrounds/route.ts` — 43 lines, no caller
+
+**Now the call cannot happen.** A stale tab requesting `/api/backgrounds` gets a
+404 instead of a five-second Unsplash round trip, and that 404 is itself the
+proof of which explanation was right.
+
+**This deliberately touches an API route**, which Part II.3 of the brief lists as
+out of scope. The exception is narrow and worth stating: this route has zero
+callers, returns `{ images: [] }` whenever `UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY` is unset, and
+implements no business logic. Leaving a public endpoint that proxies a
+third-party image search with no consumer is a liability, not a feature. It is
+one `git revert` away if that judgement is wrong.
+
+`UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY` is still read by `apps/web/prisma/seed-product-images.ts`,
+a manual seeding script that is not part of any build or request path. That is
+left alone.
+
+### The Unsplash dependency, end to end
+
+| | before | after |
+|---|---|---|
+| Third-party requests before first paint | 2 (~8s each measured) | **0** |
+| Hero LCP element | 2400px remote JPEG via CSS `url()` | drawn in CSS |
+| Images preloaded per homepage visit | entire pool, twice | **0** |
+| `preconnect` / `dns-prefetch` to a third party | 2 | **0** |
+| Dead code paths | 2 files, 106 lines | **0** |
